...I'll watch carefully and drive safely.

957
00:50:39,280 --> 00:50:41,080
なんかあ...
Like...

958
00:50:41,880 --> 00:50:44,080
頑張って説明してもお...
Even if I try my best to explain...

959
00:50:44,580 --> 00:50:47,080
反映までが遅いのじゃあ...
...it takes so long for it to respond...

960
00:50:47,880 --> 00:50:51,080
時速4キロで左に進むのじゃあ！
Go left at four kilometers per hour!

961
00:50:53,080 --> 00:50:56,580
了解お兄さん、左に寄りつつ時速4キロで進むね。
Understood, Brother. Edging left at four kilometers per hour.

962
00:50:56,880 --> 00:50:57,680
うん。
Yeah.

963
00:50:57,680 --> 00:51:00,080
ちょっと緊張するけど、前も後も確認しながらやるよ。
I'm a little nervous, but I'll check both front and back.

964
00:51:00,080 --> 00:51:01,380
頼むのじゃ。
I'm counting on you.

965
00:51:03,580 --> 00:51:06,880
やっぱ優しく教えたい気持ちはありつつも...
I really do want to teach gently, but...

966
00:51:07,580 --> 00:51:11,580
ありつつもではありますのじゃ...
...even with that feeling, it's tough...

967
00:51:12,280 --> 00:51:14,080
よし、公道出るよ。
Alright, heading onto the public road.

968
00:51:14,880 --> 00:51:16,480
一旦止まるのじゃ！
Stop for a moment!

969
00:51:16,480 --> 00:51:18,580
いよいよ道路に出るね？すごく楽しみ。
Finally getting onto the road, huh? So exciting!

970
00:51:18,580 --> 00:51:20,280
一旦止まるのじゃ！
Stop for a moment!

971
00:51:20,880 --> 00:51:22,580
一旦止まるのじゃあ！
Stop for a second!

972
00:51:23,680 --> 00:51:24,880
聞いてる？
Are you listening?

973
00:51:25,080 --> 00:51:26,580
了解お兄さん、ここで止まるのじゃ。
Understood, Brother. Stopping here.

974
